WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.874 --> 00:00:05.708
I just always think about

00:00:05.708 --> 00:00:06.793
what she'd be like if she

00:00:06.793 --> 00:00:08.252
had a chance to grow up.

00:00:09.066 --> 00:00:10.234
I miss her so much.

00:00:12.733 --> 00:00:13.692
The Zodiac.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:17.293
The classic unsolved

00:00:17.293 --> 00:00:18.544
American crime.

00:00:19.888 --> 00:00:22.015
"This is the Zodiac speaking.”

00:00:24.101 --> 00:00:25.185
It's America's most

00:00:25.185 --> 00:00:26.186
famous cold case.

00:00:31.315 --> 00:00:32.524
Thomas Horan interview.

00:00:32.524 --> 00:00:33.233
Take one.

00:00:34.601 --> 00:00:36.251
Nobody has come close to

00:00:36.251 --> 00:00:38.460
cracking this for over 50 years.

00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:39.878
I believed all the murders

00:00:39.878 --> 00:00:41.338
were committed by one person.

00:00:41.738 --> 00:00:42.698
That doesn't make any sense.

00:00:42.965 --> 00:00:44.341
The ballistics don't match.

00:00:45.148 --> 00:00:46.483
The fingerprints don’t match.

00:00:46.937 --> 00:00:48.022
The witness descriptions

00:00:48.022 --> 00:00:49.481
and survivor descriptions

00:00:49.481 --> 00:00:50.900
of the killer don’t match.

00:00:54.748 --> 00:00:56.865
This is the first time 32 letters

00:00:56.865 --> 00:00:58.074
have ever been analyzed...

00:00:58.074 --> 00:00:59.910
with artificial intelligence.

00:01:02.171 --> 00:01:03.464
I've never talked about it.

00:01:03.584 --> 00:01:04.459
I just assumed he might

00:01:04.459 --> 00:01:04.959
come for me.

00:01:06.365 --> 00:01:07.157
I'd been arrested

00:01:07.157 --> 00:01:08.463
as the Zodiac.

00:01:08.531 --> 00:01:09.991
Did you kill Darlene?

00:01:13.058 --> 00:01:13.933
What if there is

00:01:13.933 --> 00:01:15.518
no Zodiac killer?

